---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import testimonialData from "../data/testimonials.json";
const testimonials = testimonialData.testimonials;
---
<Base title="About Janna Lyn" active="About">
  <section>
    <div class="wrap split">
      <img src="/images/20220501_081901-scaled.jpg" alt="Janna Lyn on vacation" />
      <div class="prose">
        <span class="eyebrow">About</span>
        <h1>Once upon a time, a girl who loved to travel…</h1>
        <p><strong>That girl is me — Janna Lyn, your trusted travel advisor.</strong></p>
        <p>Hi everyone! I'm absolutely in love with all things travel — well, except for flight delays. Let's be honest, nobody enjoys those!</p>
        <p>By day, I pay my bills as an insurance account manager (yes, it sounds as boring as it is), but my true calling is my work as a travel advisor. I've been traveling most of my life and officially became a travel advisor in 2017. Since then, I've been living the dream!</p>
        <p>Over the years I've frequented most of the Caribbean, visited several European countries, and traveled to twenty-eight states. I'm also a Disney and Universal Studios Specialist.</p>
        <p>My life is truly blessed — the good Lord has kept me safe on countless adventures, and my bucket list is long. I'd love to help you start checking off yours.</p>
        <a class="btn" href="/contact" style="margin-top: 12px;">Let's plan something</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- PLACEHOLDER TESTIMONIALS: Janna, replace these with real client quotes in the site editor (Testimonials) before relying on them. -->
  <section class="alt">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Kind words</span>
      <h2>Travelers I've helped</h2>
      <div class="card-grid" style="margin-top: 32px;">
        {testimonials.map((t) => (
          <div class="card"><div class="card-body">
            <div class="meta">{t.trip}</div>
            <p>&ldquo;{t.quote}&rdquo;</p>
            <p style="margin-top: 14px;"><strong>— {t.name}</strong></p>
          </div></div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p style="margin-top: 24px;">Ready to become the next happy traveler? <a href="/contact">Let's plan your trip</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
